size_t register_grenade(plid pid, unsigned team, fvec3 pos, fvec3 vel, clk fuse) ->
Creates a grenade on the server side.
Returns <samp><code>(size_t)-1</code></samp> and doesn't create the grenade if out of memory.
Returns the grenade's index otherwise.
Its index is unspecified.

size_t spawn_grenade(plid pid, unsigned team, fvec3 pos, fvec3 vel, clk fuse) ->
Creates a grenade.
Calls register_grenade() and (if not out of memory) send_grenade().
Returns the grenade's index, or <samp><code>(size_t)-1</code></samp> if out of memory.

void remove_grenade(size_t index) ->
Removes a grenade on the server side.
Invokes undefined behavior if <var>index</var> does not point to an existing grenade.

void detonate_grenade(size_t index) ->
Detonates a grenade on the server side.
Calls remove_grenade().
