Damages all players not on the same team as the grenade's owner, less than 16 away on each axis if a ray can be cast from the grenade to that player's head.
Does 4096&minus;distance(grenadePos, playerPos)<sup>2</sup> damage.
Calls block_action() at the grenade's position with <var>type</var>=3 and <var>pid</var> equal to the grenade's owner.
